  {
    "id": 2006012010060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──すまなかった、プロデューサー\r\nさっき、答えることができなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、気にしなくていいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "先方だって今日決め切ろうってつもりじゃなかったし\r\nゆっくり考えて、いい答えを出してくれたらいいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──……うん……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうした？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……今のところ、適切な答えが……\r\nイメージもできていなくてね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『こんな私の一枚なら、\r\nファンのみんなは喜んでくれるんじゃないか』──",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……そういう案なら、ないこともないのだけれど",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど、それが『私が一番撮りたい自分、伝えたい自分』\r\nと言えるのかと思ったら……",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010110"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──まぁ確かに\r\n咲耶は特に、ファンを第一に考えるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンが見たいものを見せようとするのは\r\n咲耶の希望だと言えるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、純粋な咲耶だけの希望とも言い切れない\r\n──みたいな感じか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──ああ\r\nなかなか難しいテーマさ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "撮りたい……伝えたい──……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010140"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンが喜んでくれることをしたい、って答えだって\r\n素晴らしいものだと俺は思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──でも、せっかく引っかかったんだ\r\nこのチャンスに、しっかり考えてみようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……そうだね\r\nフフ。せっかく、か……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010160"
  },
  {
    "select": "好きなものに\r\n囲まれてみるとか",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "？\r\n何か違ったか……？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "……まぁ、\r\nゆっくりな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010170,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それではアンティーカが勢揃いしてしまうけれど\r\nスケジュールは大丈夫かい？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん！？　んー……！\r\nその時は、最大限努力するよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、冗談のつもりだったのに",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど──そうだな\r\n最大限努力してくれるというのなら……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "その場合は、アナタにもいてほしいと添えておこうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の愛するアンティーカには、\r\nアナタだって不可欠なのだからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おいおい……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010230,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ううん、そうではなくて\r\n私は、引っかかること自体まずいことだと思っていたから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それをアナタは、せっかく、と──\r\nポジティブに言うのだなと思って",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "素敵な捉え方を教えてもらっただけだよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そういうことか……！\r\nいやまぁ、たいしたことではないんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──けど、重ねて言うぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もし自分を責めてしまいそうだったら\r\nそんなことはしなくていいんだからな、咲耶",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──ああ。ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010260"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はきっと、焦る気持ちもあるだろうから\r\n寮に戻って、落ち着いてからとかさ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601201/2006012010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が答えを出せることではないけど──\r\n相談だったら、いつでも乗れるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012010280,
